  <section id="how-to-read">
    <h2>How to read this page</h2>
    <p>
      This is a short entry of about 150 words, and it is a shortened version
      of the longer unsigned profile on
      <a href={longVersion}>Circassian Center</a> (which Biyografi.Net also
      copies). It has the same facts in the same order, with most details cut.
      It is also someone else’s published work, so I haven’t translated it in
      full. This page summarizes it, translates a few short sentences, and
      lists where it differs from the longer text. Please have a Turkish reader
      check my translations.
    </p>
    <p>
      <mark>Highlighted text marked “Review”</mark> is something I’m unsure of
      or that disagrees with another source on this site. The entry has no
      references.
    </p>
